{"id":"1aa3ad8d378fa3a5","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-feasible-interpolation.md","title":"Feasible Interpolation","display":"thm-feasible-interpolation — Feasible Interpolation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-feasible-interpolation","aliases":["72-thm-feasible-interpolation"],"display":"thm-feasible-interpolation — Feasible Interpolation","depends_on":["[[72-df-resolution-system]]","[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","[[72-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 9.3.5; printed pp. 613-615; PDF pp. 625-627","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_status":"Both source constructions reviewed; linear gate-count induction and all proof annotations not fully reconstructed","round2_verification_status":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-feasible-interpolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-feasible-interpolation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-feasible-interpolation — Feasible Interpolation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"789eea8538e194e6\" href=\"?note=789eea8538e194e6\" title=\"72-df-boolean-circuit\">72-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 9.3.5; printed pp. 613-615; PDF pp. 625-627"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Both source constructions reviewed; linear gate-count induction and all proof annotations not fully reconstructed"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a\">\\(\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历有限子句集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResRefutation}\">\\(\\operatorname{ResRefutation}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\">\\(X,Y,Z\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PV})\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PV})\\)</span>；下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Split}\">\\(\\operatorname{Split}\\)</span> 显式约束其两两不交和两侧变量范围。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Circuit}_X,⟦ C⟧_a,\\operatorname{size}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Circuit}_X,⟦ C⟧_a,\\operatorname{size}(C)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"789eea8538e194e6\" href=\"?note=789eea8538e194e6\" title=\"72-df-boolean-circuit\">72-df-boolean-circuit</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 遍历有限子句序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|d|\">\\(|d|\\)</span> 表示其固定编码位数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)\\)</span> 是下面按子句及公共变量赋值定义的谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{X}\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{X}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FP}\">\\(\\mathrm{FP}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wn}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{wn}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\omega\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\\in\\mathrm{FP}\">\\(\\mathcal E\\in\\mathrm{FP}\\)</span> 是总串函数，输入码及输出解析均由下式固定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\">\\(S_0\\)</span> 是有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(h)\">\\(S_0\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(h:\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\restriction S_0\">\\(h\\restriction S_0\\)</span> 单射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enum}_h(S_0)\">\\(\\operatorname{enum}_h(S_0)\\)</span> 是按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wn}\\circ h\">\\(\\operatorname{wn}\\circ h\\)</span> 递增的唯一枚举。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示唯一描述，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 为有限串接，空串接为空串；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seg},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm cl},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm Res}\">\\(\\operatorname{seg},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm cl},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm Res}\\)</span> 取归结定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}\\)</span> 对公式使用已给定的命题编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{setcode}_h\">\\(\\operatorname{setcode}_h\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 对所列有限集合单射时调用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>门标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf g_0,\\ldots,\\mathsf g_4\">\\(\\mathsf g_0,\\ldots,\\mathsf g_4\\)</span> 取电路定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k\\in\\omega\">\\(j,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_{\\rm circ}\">\\(\\mathcal G_{\\rm circ}\\)</span> 是门描述集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ}\">\\(\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ}\\)</span> 是有限合法单输出电路集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\langle m,g\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ}\">\\(C=\\langle m,g\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{gatecode},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\rm circ}\">\\(\\operatorname{gatecode},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\rm circ}\\)</span> 的定义域分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_{\\rm circ},\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ},\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\mathcal G_{\\rm circ},\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ},\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0\">\\(C_0\\)</span> 为固定常数零电路。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}\\)</span> 为 Assertion 定义的有限子句集合变量支持函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{enum}_h(S_0)&amp;:=\\iota s\\in S_0^{|S_0|}\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{ran}(s)=S_0\\land\n\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|S_0|\\ (\\operatorname{wn}(h(s_i))&lt;\\operatorname{wn}(h(s_j)))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{setcode}_h(S_0)&amp;:=\\mathop{\\frown}_{i&lt;|S_0|}\\operatorname{seg}(h(\\operatorname{enum}_h(S_0)_i)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm FI}(d,A,B,X,Y,Z)&amp;:=\n\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm Res}(d))\n\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm cl}}(A))\n\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm cl}}(B))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}}(X))\n\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}}(Y))\n\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}}(Z)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{enum}_h(S_0)&amp;:=\\iota s\\in S_0^{|S_0|}\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{ran}(s)=S_0\\land\n\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|S_0|\\ (\\operatorname{wn}(h(s_i))&lt;\\operatorname{wn}(h(s_j)))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{setcode}_h(S_0)&amp;:=\\mathop{\\frown}_{i&lt;|S_0|}\\operatorname{seg}(h(\\operatorname{enum}_h(S_0)_i)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm FI}(d,A,B,X,Y,Z)&amp;:=\n\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm Res}(d))\n\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm cl}}(A))\n\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm cl}}(B))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}}(X))\n\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}}(Y))\n\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}}(Z)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal G_{\\rm circ}&amp;:=(\\{\\mathsf g_0\\}\\times\\mathsf{PV})\\cup\n(\\{\\mathsf g_4\\}\\times\\{0,1\\})\\cup(\\{\\mathsf g_1\\}\\times\\omega)\n\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf g_2,j,k\\rangle,\\langle\\mathsf g_3,j,k\\rangle:j,k\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ}&amp;:=\\left\\{\\langle m,g\\rangle\\in\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\{m\\}\\times\\mathcal G_{\\rm circ}^m:\n\\exists X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}(\\mathsf{PV})\\ \\operatorname{Circuit}_X(\\langle m,g\\rangle)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_0,p\\rangle)&amp;:=\\langle0,0,0\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{enc}(p),\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_1,j\\rangle)&amp;:=\\langle0,0,1\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{enc}(p_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_2,j,k\\rangle)&amp;:=\\langle0,1,0\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}(p_j))\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}(p_k)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_3,j,k\\rangle)&amp;:=\\langle0,1,1\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}(p_j))\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}(p_k)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_4,b\\rangle)&amp;:=\\langle1,0,0,b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ}(C)&amp;:=\\mathop{\\frown}_{i&lt;m}\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{gatecode}(g(i))),\\\\\nC_0&amp;:=\\langle1,\\{\\langle0,\\langle\\mathsf g_4,0\\rangle\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dec}_{\\rm circ}(w)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\n\\iota C\\in\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ}\\ (\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ}(C)=w),&amp;w\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ}),\\\\\nC_0,&amp;w\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ}).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal G_{\\rm circ}&amp;:=(\\{\\mathsf g_0\\}\\times\\mathsf{PV})\\cup\n(\\{\\mathsf g_4\\}\\times\\{0,1\\})\\cup(\\{\\mathsf g_1\\}\\times\\omega)\n\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf g_2,j,k\\rangle,\\langle\\mathsf g_3,j,k\\rangle:j,k\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ}&amp;:=\\left\\{\\langle m,g\\rangle\\in\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\{m\\}\\times\\mathcal G_{\\rm circ}^m:\n\\exists X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}(\\mathsf{PV})\\ \\operatorname{Circuit}_X(\\langle m,g\\rangle)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_0,p\\rangle)&amp;:=\\langle0,0,0\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{enc}(p),\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_1,j\\rangle)&amp;:=\\langle0,0,1\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{enc}(p_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_2,j,k\\rangle)&amp;:=\\langle0,1,0\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}(p_j))\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}(p_k)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_3,j,k\\rangle)&amp;:=\\langle0,1,1\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}(p_j))\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}(p_k)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_4,b\\rangle)&amp;:=\\langle1,0,0,b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ}(C)&amp;:=\\mathop{\\frown}_{i&lt;m}\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{gatecode}(g(i))),\\\\\nC_0&amp;:=\\langle1,\\{\\langle0,\\langle\\mathsf g_4,0\\rangle\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dec}_{\\rm circ}(w)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\n\\iota C\\in\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ}\\ (\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ}(C)=w),&amp;w\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ}),\\\\\nC_0,&amp;w\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ}).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(A)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{PV}:\\exists D\\in A\\;(p\\in D\\lor\\neg p\\in D)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(A)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{PV}:\\exists D\\in A\\;(p\\in D\\lor\\neg p\\in D)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Split}(A,B,X,Y,Z)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nX\\cap Y=X\\cap Z=Y\\cap Z=\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(A)\\subseteq X\\cup Y\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(B)\\subseteq X\\cup Z.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Split}(A,B,X,Y,Z)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nX\\cap Y=X\\cap Z=Y\\cap Z=\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(A)\\subseteq X\\cup Y\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(B)\\subseteq X\\cup Z.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\neg\\exists b\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;\n\\Bigl(b\\upharpoonright X=a\\land\n\\forall D\\in A\\;\\exists l\\in D\\;⟦ l⟧_b=1\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\neg\\exists b\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;\n\\Bigl(b\\upharpoonright X=a\\land\n\\forall D\\in A\\;\\exists l\\in D\\;⟦ l⟧_b=1\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathcal E\\in\\mathrm{FP}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall A,B,X,Y,Z,d\\;\n\\Bigl((\\operatorname{Split}(A,B,X,Y,Z)\\land\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(d,A\\cup B))\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n\\exists C\\;\\bigl(&amp;C=\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm FI}(d,A,B,X,Y,Z)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C)\\leq c|d|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^X\\;\n((⟦ C⟧_a=0\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A))\n\\land(⟦ C⟧_a=1\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(B)))\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathcal E\\in\\mathrm{FP}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall A,B,X,Y,Z,d\\;\n\\Bigl((\\operatorname{Split}(A,B,X,Y,Z)\\land\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(d,A\\cup B))\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n\\exists C\\;\\bigl(&amp;C=\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm FI}(d,A,B,X,Y,Z)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C)\\leq c|d|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^X\\;\n((⟦ C⟧_a=0\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A))\n\\land(⟦ C⟧_a=1\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(B)))\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，Theorem 9.3.5，印刷页 613–614，PDF 页 625–626；原书给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(|d|)\">\\(O(|d|)\\)</span> 大小电路，且说明按电路输出可从相应一侧构造不大于原反驳的反驳。这里形式化其中电路提取及两个输出条件，未抄入第二个大小结论。</li>\n<li>修正了原先只用自然语言声称存在 extractor、却没有定义其输入、输出、作用变量或真假条件的缺口。输出为共享变量上的电路，而非要求多项式大小的公式；输出 0 对应左侧不可满足，输出 1 对应右侧不可满足，方向与原书一致。</li>\n<li>本次核对陈述并阅读两种证明思路，未完整重建线性门数估计。给定公共赋值时，对公共枢轴保留变成假的枢轴文字所在父子句，对私有枢轴照常归结；最后空子句的祖先不混合两个私有变量集合。这说明电路可决定哪一侧不可满足。</li>\n<li>Feasible interpolation is a property of particular proof systems; it is not asserted for an arbitrary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本次把提取器的六分量输入码、电路门码及非法码分支写成显式函数。有限集合排序使用已定义的串序号；各门和证明行的自定界封装保证唯一解析。编码和解析只处理显式有限列表，所用命题公式码满足上游的多项式编码条件；门数界仍然以原归结证明的编码位数为尺度。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"789eea8538e194e6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]；$A,B$ 遍历有限子句集合，$\\operatorname{ResRefutation}$ 如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]；$A,B$ 遍历有限子句集合，$\\operatorname{ResRefutation}$ 如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"789eea8538e194e6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Circuit}_X,⟦ C⟧_a,\\operatorname{size}(C)$ 如 [[72-df-boolean-circuit]]；$d$ 遍历有限子句序列，$|d|$ 表示其固定编码位数。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)$ 是下面按子句及公共变量赋值定义的谓词；$a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{X}$。$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\mathrm{FP}$ 与 $\\operatorname{wn}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\omega$ 取 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]。$\\mathcal E\\in\\mathrm{FP}$ 是总串函数，输入码及输出解析均由下式固定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ResRefutation}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PV})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Split}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Circuit}_X,⟦ C⟧_a,\\operatorname{size}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"|d|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{X}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wn}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E\\in\\mathrm{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"S_0","display":false},{"tex":"S_0\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(h)","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"h\\restriction S_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enum}_h(S_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wn}\\circ h","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{seg},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm cl},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm Res}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{setcode}_h","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf g_0,\\ldots,\\mathsf g_4","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{PV}","display":false},{"tex":"j,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_{\\rm circ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ}","display":false},{"tex":"C=\\langle m,g\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{gatecode},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\rm circ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_{\\rm circ},\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ},\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"C_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{enum}_h(S_0)&:=\\iota s\\in S_0^{|S_0|}\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{ran}(s)=S_0\\land\n\\forall i<j<|S_0|\\ (\\operatorname{wn}(h(s_i))<\\operatorname{wn}(h(s_j)))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{setcode}_h(S_0)&:=\\mathop{\\frown}_{i<|S_0|}\\operatorname{seg}(h(\\operatorname{enum}_h(S_0)_i)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm FI}(d,A,B,X,Y,Z)&:=\n\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm Res}(d))\n\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm cl}}(A))\n\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm cl}}(B))\\\\\n&\\quad\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}}(X))\n\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}}(Y))\n\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{setcode}_{\\operatorname{enc}}(Z)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal G_{\\rm circ}&:=(\\{\\mathsf g_0\\}\\times\\mathsf{PV})\\cup\n(\\{\\mathsf g_4\\}\\times\\{0,1\\})\\cup(\\{\\mathsf g_1\\}\\times\\omega)\n\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf g_2,j,k\\rangle,\\langle\\mathsf g_3,j,k\\rangle:j,k\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ}&:=\\left\\{\\langle m,g\\rangle\\in\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\{m\\}\\times\\mathcal G_{\\rm circ}^m:\n\\exists X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}(\\mathsf{PV})\\ \\operatorname{Circuit}_X(\\langle m,g\\rangle)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_0,p\\rangle)&:=\\langle0,0,0\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{enc}(p),\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_1,j\\rangle)&:=\\langle0,0,1\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{enc}(p_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_2,j,k\\rangle)&:=\\langle0,1,0\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}(p_j))\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}(p_k)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_3,j,k\\rangle)&:=\\langle0,1,1\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}(p_j))\\frown\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{enc}(p_k)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{gatecode}(\\langle\\mathsf g_4,b\\rangle)&:=\\langle1,0,0,b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ}(C)&:=\\mathop{\\frown}_{i<m}\\operatorname{seg}(\\operatorname{gatecode}(g(i))),\\\\\nC_0&:=\\langle1,\\{\\langle0,\\langle\\mathsf g_4,0\\rangle\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dec}_{\\rm circ}(w)&:=\\begin{cases}\n\\iota C\\in\\mathcal C_{\\rm circ}\\ (\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ}(C)=w),&w\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ}),\\\\\nC_0,&w\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm circ}).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(A)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{PV}:\\exists D\\in A\\;(p\\in D\\lor\\neg p\\in D)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Split}(A,B,X,Y,Z)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nX\\cap Y=X\\cap Z=Y\\cap Z=\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(A)\\subseteq X\\cup Y\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(B)\\subseteq X\\cup Z.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\neg\\exists b\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;\n\\Bigl(b\\upharpoonright X=a\\land\n\\forall D\\in A\\;\\exists l\\in D\\;⟦ l⟧_b=1\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\mathcal E\\in\\mathrm{FP}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall A,B,X,Y,Z,d\\;\n\\Bigl((\\operatorname{Split}(A,B,X,Y,Z)\\land\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(d,A\\cup B))\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n\\exists C\\;\\bigl(&C=\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\rm FI}(d,A,B,X,Y,Z)))\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C)\\leq c|d|\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^X\\;\n((⟦ C⟧_a=0\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A))\n\\land(⟦ C⟧_a=1\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(B)))\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"O(|d|)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":7581,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-386","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-feasible-interpolation|thm-feasible-interpolation — Feasible Interpolation]]"}],"outgoing":["e585861c4ee3b135","d6da6d3f3489ef90","789eea8538e194e6","d9d13f2ac55f5a6d"]}